OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGradually
OL,6,Fturning cloudier from the west this
OL,7,Fevening, though staying largely dry.
OL,8,FSome showers possible by the morning.
OL,9,FAnother warm night under cloud cover.
OL,10,FMuch breezier by the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA cooler day to come on
OL,13,FSunday, cloud with a risk of showers
OL,14,Finitially, these may turn heavy at
OL,15,Ftimes. Turning brighter with showers
OL,16,Fbecoming more isolated later. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
